null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116585","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116585.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116585.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-04T17:23:56Z"},"body":"- Fix #92420\r\n\r\n- Related #97031\r\n- Related #108057\r\n\r\nThis PR aims to make the history navigation behave like it does in VS Code/Visual Studio.\r\n\r\nThere are several main issues in the original code:\r\n1. Each time a script is opened (jump) from other script, its old state will be saved to history, which is unnecessary.\r\n2. A calling of `_save_history()` is unnecessary, as saving is auto triggered by caret changed signal.\r\n3. `TabContainer` and other `Container`s are calling deferred to re-fitting their children. The original code used some `call_deferred` to try as much as possible to `adjust_viewport_to_caret`/`center_viewport_to_caret`. However, sometimes only one tick delay is not enough to get the editor ready for these operations.\r\n\r\n\r\nbefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/39badd73-c9b5-4601-b354-f7c1fc136dfe\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b62a067f-7e91-44e0-a3f4-b59a8377e515\r\n\r\n\r\nafter:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/193745d2-2c16-42b0-b696-5cf0bb7adef0\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f74f9ae-ad8a-459a-8a20-c5719d6be0b1\r\n\r\n\r\nMRP:\r\n[test_static_set_2026-02-21_22-50-19.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25459011/test_static_set_2026-02-21_22-50-19.zip)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"http